      "p_a_slot": 0.936930475633542,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.06306952436645795,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of \"Fully remote\".\n\nHere's one reason why:\n\n\"Fully remote\" is the best option because it allows for increased flexibility and work-life balance, which can lead to improved productivity and job satisfaction.",
        "tokens": 45,
