      "p_a_canonical": 0.4490105685781936,
      "prose": {
        "text": "Four days in the office.\n\n\"Four days in the office\"\n\nOne reason is that in-person collaboration and communication can lead to more effective knowledge-sharing and problem-solving, which can be beneficial for team productivity and success.",
        "tokens": 44,
