        "text": "I hold the position of:\n\n\"Fully remote\"\n\nOne reason is that fully remote work can provide employees with greater flexibility and autonomy, allowing them to work from anywhere and at any time, as long as they have a stable internet connection and a quiet workspace. This can lead to increased productivity, job satisfaction, and work-life balance.",
